WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:03.099
Open Canvas and choose the sidebar plus to add a board.

2
00:00:03.099 --> 00:00:07.741
Name the board, keep Blank selected, and choose Create Canvas.

3
00:00:07.741 --> 00:00:12.953
Choose Add Card, choose a Card, and click the board to place it.

4
00:00:12.954 --> 00:00:24.529
Write a title and a note inside the Card.
